{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a team of government stalkers. Your mission is to clean up the aftermath of failed experiments in laboratories that studied other dimensions.\u00a0Your superiors are driven by personal gain, so collecting unknown artifacts for subsequent sale is also part of your duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The locations of your missions operate by their own rules\u2014will you be able to master them all?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your death will not be in vain.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/setsh.gif?t=1743517722\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Each stalker has unique traits that manifest upon death.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/gif_skills.gif?t=1743517722\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enemies\u2014or perhaps friends, depending on your perspective\u2014await you at the mission sites.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/extras/chupa.gif?t=1743517722\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be cautious when collecting artifacts\u2014contact with them can have unpredictable consequences.</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605910?t=1743517722","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/f4a52e385b30bac9b8e74933780d157a7b462017/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743517722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/f6b8f919e238054c237d953ff2fb79ccbdbd9850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743517722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605910/f6b8f919e238054c237d953ff2fb79ccbdbd9850/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743517722","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","i